# --- JumpStarter: agent control files ---------------------------------------
# Track the agent definitions; keep the rest of .claude/ machine-local.
# The order matters: the un-ignore lines must come after the ignore line.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/
# Codex role definitions are project control files. Other .codex configuration remains
# project-owned rather than being treated as machine-local by JumpStarter.
!/.codex/agents/
# Uncomment the next line if this project tracks its build packets (recommended:
# a packet is the record of what was authorized, and reviews cite it).
#!/.claude/packets/
# --- end JumpStarter ---------------------------------------------------------
